
# Community Passport App Notes

## Project
The app is called Community Passport for The Loop Social.

Live site:
https://robbjprice.github.io/communitypassport/

GitHub repo:
https://github.com/robbjprice/communitypassport

## Current build status
This is a static HTML, CSS, and JavaScript prototype hosted on GitHub Pages.

Core files:
- index.html
- style.css
- script.js

## Important development preference
Robb prefers full replacement code files, not small snippets, when making coding changes.

## Current functionality
The app currently includes:
- Digital passport for participants
- Participant registration modal
- QR scan simulation
- Stamp collection
- Progress tracker
- Prize eligibility tiers
- Admin dashboard
- Business directory
- Business selection for event participation
- Selected QR URL generation
- CSV export buttons
- Simulated contest email section
- Prototype admin users
- Prototype admin login

## Admin system
Admin password for prototype:
loopadmin

The admin button is currently visible but may not yet be fully functional.

Likely issue:
index.html may not have the exact IDs required by script.js.

Required admin button ID:
adminButton

Required admin login modal ID:
adminLoginModal

Required admin password input ID:
adminPassword

Required admin login button ID:
adminLoginBtn

Required admin cancel button ID:
adminCancelBtn

Required admin logout button ID:
adminLogoutBtn

## Current bug / next step
The admin button does not open the login modal yet.

Next likely fix:
Replace the full index.html file with a version that matches the current script.js exactly.

After that, verify:
- Admin button opens login modal
- Password loopadmin opens dashboard
- Logout works
- Business selection works
- QR URLs update
- CSV exports work

## Future backend plan
Supabase will be added later after the front-end prototype is stable.

Supabase will eventually handle:
- Real participant database
- Real admin login/auth
- Real stamp records
- Business/event management
- Exportable participant/stamp data
- Possibly email integrations

## Important principle
For now, GitHub is the source of truth for code.
The doc file is the project memory so progress is not lost if ChatGPT/Ask Chat freezes.
